    "type": "game",
    "name": "Nebula Cleanup Crew",
    "steam_appid": 3432070,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nebula Cleanup Crew is a short length, roguelike bullet-hell game where you rescue your crew members by defeating waves of enemies leading up to bosses. Once a crew member is rescued you can play as them! The average session will last 3-10 minutes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THERMAL WARFARE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon alters your ship's core temperature as you pave the way to a crew member needing rescue. Superheat or Superchill your ship to use powerful thermal special attacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FREEZE your enemies, then hit them with SCORCH damage to cause a FLARE blast outward from the enemy. Or, OVERHEAT them and then hit with FROSTBITE damage to create damaging ICE SHRAPNEL and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432070/extras/b6e448342f99b5b0de9ae10ca1219adf.poster.avif?t=1755219671\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432070/extras/b6e448342f99b5b0de9ae10ca1219adf.webm?t=1755219671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432070/extras/b6e448342f99b5b0de9ae10ca1219adf.mp4?t=1755219671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RESCUE THE CREW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat Nebula Bosses to rescue and unlock your crew members as playable ships!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432070/extras/8661c3994e4d9478f58b1ff3a0b24a46.poster.avif?t=1755219671\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432070/extras/8661c3994e4d9478f58b1ff3a0b24a46.webm?t=1755219671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432070/extras/8661c3994e4d9478f58b1ff3a0b24a46.mp4?t=1755219671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR WEAPONRY</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change what happens when in Extreme Temperature Zones! For example, COLD bullets double in size when fired while you're in a COLD Extreme Temperature Zone! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also upgrade fundamental stats like ammo usage, weapon effects, and your COLD and HOT abilities. Unlock all the options for over 60 total upgrades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432070/extras/778ba72090be86acb4c06a4852836456.poster.avif?t=1755219671\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432070/extras/778ba72090be86acb4c06a4852836456.webm?t=1755219671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT TO EXPECT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 hand-crafted maps full of enemies to defeat, including 2 bosses. Each run features different maps and each map has a touch of procedural generation to keep things fresh!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be short. Each session will last between 3 and 10 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 custom music tracks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Stagger enemies with your thermal arsenal! Over 60 upgrades for your weaponry, ship stats and abilities - many of them unlocked after completing various challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player, fully offline close-quarters action gameplay: no internet required.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No microtransactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just a father and son making a game in our off-hours. We\u2019re having a blast designing, coding, and drawing it all ourselves \u2014 and we hope you have a blast playing it!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nebula Cleanup Crew is a short length, roguelike bullet-hell game where you rescue your crew members by defeating waves of enemies leading up to bosses. Once a crew member is rescued you can play as them! The average session will last 3-10 minutes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THERMAL WARFARE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon alters your ship's core temperature as you pave the way to a crew member needing rescue. Superheat or Superchill your ship to use powerful thermal special attacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FREEZE your enemies, then hit them with SCORCH damage to cause a FLARE blast outward from the enemy. Or, OVERHEAT them and then hit with FROSTBITE damage to create damaging ICE SHRAPNEL and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432070/extras/b6e448342f99b5b0de9ae10ca1219adf.poster.avif?t=1755219671\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432070/extras/b6e448342f99b5b0de9ae10ca1219adf.webm?t=1755219671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432070/extras/b6e448342f99b5b0de9ae10ca1219adf.mp4?t=1755219671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RESCUE THE CREW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat Nebula Bosses to rescue and unlock your crew members as playable ships!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432070/extras/8661c3994e4d9478f58b1ff3a0b24a46.poster.avif?t=1755219671\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432070/extras/8661c3994e4d9478f58b1ff3a0b24a46.webm?t=1755219671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432070/extras/8661c3994e4d9478f58b1ff3a0b24a46.mp4?t=1755219671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR WEAPONRY</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change what happens when in Extreme Temperature Zones! For example, COLD bullets double in size when fired while you're in a COLD Extreme Temperature Zone! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also upgrade fundamental stats like ammo usage, weapon effects, and your COLD and HOT abilities. Unlock all the options for over 60 total upgrades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432070/extras/778ba72090be86acb4c06a4852836456.poster.avif?t=1755219671\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432070/extras/778ba72090be86acb4c06a4852836456.webm?t=1755219671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT TO EXPECT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 hand-crafted maps full of enemies to defeat, including 2 bosses. Each run features different maps and each map has a touch of procedural generation to keep things fresh!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be short. Each session will last between 3 and 10 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 custom music tracks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Stagger enemies with your thermal arsenal! Over 60 upgrades for your weaponry, ship stats and abilities - many of them unlocked after completing various challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player, fully offline close-quarters action gameplay: no internet required.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No microtransactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just a father and son making a game in our off-hours. We\u2019re having a blast designing, coding, and drawing it all ourselves \u2014 and we hope you have a blast playing it!</p>",
    "short_description": "Nebula Cleanup Crew is a short length top down action roguelite shooter with a focus on hot and cold weaponry. Rescue your crew members as you blast enemies and bosses away with super heated and chilled weapons \u2014 freeze foes, overheat them, unleash powerful thermal special attacks and more!",
